<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#080d12">
<title>ORBIT | Command Center</title>

<style>
:root {
  --bg:#080d12;
  --panel:#111b24;
  --border:#243543;
  --green:#00ff9d;
  --text:#edf5f8;
  --muted:#8ba0ae;
  --red:#ff5369;
  --yellow:#ffc857;
}
* {box-sizing:border-box}
body {
  margin:0;
  background:var(--bg);
  color:var(--text);
  font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
}
header {
  padding:20px;
  background:#0d1720;
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
}
.logo {
  font-size:36px;
  font-weight:900;
  letter-spacing:5px;
  color:var(--green);
}
.subtitle {
  color:var(--muted);
  font-size:12px;
  letter-spacing:2px;
  margin-top:5px;
}
.status {
  margin-top:15px;
  display:flex;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  gap:10px;
}
.badge {
  padding:8px 12px;
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:8px;
  font-size:12px;
}
.green {color:var(--green)}
.red {color:var(--red)}
.yellow {color:var(--yellow)}
main {
  max-width:1200px;
  margin:auto;
  padding:16px;
}
.grid {
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));
  gap:12px;
}
.card {
  background:var(--panel);
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:12px;
  padding:16px;
  margin-bottom:14px;
}
.card h3 {
  margin:0 0 12px;
  color:var(--muted);
  font-size:13px;
  letter-spacing:1px;
}
.value {
  font-size:25px;
  font-weight:bold;
  overflow-wrap:anywhere;
}
.section-title {
  color:var(--green);
  font-size:18px;
  margin:25px 0 12px;
}
table {
  width:100%;
  border-collapse:collapse;
  font-size:13px;
}
th,td {
  padding:12px 8px;
  text-align:left;
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
}
th {color:var(--muted)}
.table-wrap {overflow-x:auto}
button {
  background:var(--green);
  color:#06110c;
  border:0;
  border-radius:8px;
  padding:12px 16px;
  font-weight:bold;
  cursor:pointer;
}
button:disabled {
  opacity:.4;
  cursor:not-allowed;
}
input {
  width:100%;
  background:#09121a;
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:8px;
  padding:12px;
  color:white;
  margin-bottom:10px;
}
.notice {
  color:var(--muted);
  font-size:13px;
  line-height:1.6;
}
.alert {
  border-left:3px solid var(--yellow);
  padding:12px;
  background:#1b2024;
  margin-bottom:10px;
  border-radius:5px;
}
footer {
  text-align:center;
  padding:30px;
  color:var(--muted);
  font-size:12px;
}
@media(min-width:750px) {
  .grid {grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <div class="logo">ORBIT</div>
  <div class="subtitle">
    MARKET INTELLIGENCE COMMAND CENTER
  </div>

  <div class="status">
    <span class="badge green">● DASHBOARD ONLINE</span>
    <span class="badge yellow">● RESEARCH MODE</span>
    <span class="badge red">● LIVE DATA DISCONNECTED</span>
    <span class="badge">EXECUTION DISABLED</span>
  </div>
</header>

<main>

<div class="grid">
  <div class="card">
    <h3>MARKET FEED</h3>
    <div class="value yellow">OFFLINE</div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h3>TRACKED TOKENS</h3>
    <div class="value" id="tracked">0</div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h3>BUY CANDIDATES</h3>
    <div class="value green" id="candidates">0</div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h3>TRADING ENGINE</h3>
    <div class="value red">DISABLED</div>
  </div>
</div>

<h2 class="section-title">MARKET RESEARCH</h2>

<div class="card">
  <h3>DATA SOURCES</h3>
  <p>Pump.fun: <span class="red">Not connected</span></p>
  <p>FOMO: <span class="red">Not connected</span></p>
  <p>Solana: <span class="yellow">Awaiting integration</span></p>
  <p class="notice">
    ORBIT will research token launches, market momentum,
    liquidity, holder behavior, and narrative strength
    once verified market-data connections are installed.
  </p>
</div>

<h2 class="section-title">TOKEN WATCHLIST</h2>

<div class="card">
  <h3>ADD TOKEN TO LOCAL WATCHLIST</h3>

  <input id="tokenName"
    placeholder="Token name or symbol">

  <input id="tokenMint"
    placeholder="Solana token mint address">

  <button onclick="addToken()">ADD TO WATCHLIST</button>

  <p class="notice">
    Watchlist entries are saved locally in this browser.
    Adding a token does not start live monitoring.
  </p>
</div>

